				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="123" _ulen="91" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌 비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="300" inout="out" _len="324" _ulen="246" >

PROS_BRCD^처리 지점코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
ODER_NO^주문 번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
ASPR_TYPE_CODE^호가 유형 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
ISCD^종목코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
DEAL_CLS_CODE^매매 구분 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
NCNT_QTY^미체결 수량^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
FTOP_ODER_UNPR^장내파생 주문 단가^20^2^7^0^0^0^0

